<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Yuhuda Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yuhuday Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuhuda Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yuhu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuhuday</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yuhuda kiitay xaafettiday ammanizaytas gidontta ammaniza as misatidi wordo timirte biitta gaththiza asatappe ammanizayti naagettana malassa. Nam7anththo Phexroosa kiitaa misatiza hayssa ha qaanththa kiitazan xaafezi, «Xoossay nam7anththontta mala ba derezas issito immida ammano gishshas asay minni olettana mala» nababizayta lo7eththi qofsees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wordo astamaareta timirte, hanonne kundeth <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanizayti ba ammano naagana mala imettida zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurseththa anjjo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Yesus Kirstoosas ooththiza Yaaqoobe isha Yuhudappe, inttes xeygettidaytas, Xoossay Aaway siiqizaytassinne Yesus Kirstoosi naagidaytas ubbatas,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mato 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar 6:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />maaroteththi, saroteththinne siiqoy inttes daro.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Astamaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ta siiqotoo! Nu issife attida atoteththaa gishshas ta inttes xaafanaas daro koyadisishin ha7i qasse nam7anththontta issito Xoossi asas immida ammano gishshas intte daro baaxetana mala ta inttena zorays. Ta inttes xaafanaas taas tooho gidides. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Istta bolla pirdettanayssi daro wodeppe kase istta gishshas xaafettida asati intteko kalxi gelida; heytantti Xoos eronttayta; nu Godaa kiyateththaa coo mela laammizaytanne Xoossaa goynnonttayta. Izi barkka nuna haarizayssanne nuus Godaa gidida Yesus Kirstoosakka kaddeettes.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Intte hessa ubbaaka kaseti erikkoka Goday ba dereza Gibxeppe kessidi ashshidayssanne hankko ammanonttayta guyeppe dhayssidayssa ta inttena akeekissana koyays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kessa 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Tay 14:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Hessaththoka ba bonchcho naagontta ixxidi ba dizaso yeddida kiitanchchata intte yuushshi qopite; Xoossi istta gita pirdaa gallas gakkanaas mernaa qashos girdi gida dhuman naagi woththides. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Hessaththoka Sodoomeynne Gamooray qasseka istta heeran diza katamatikka laymatidanne salo medheteththatara laymatanaas amottida; hessa gishshas istti mernaa taman xuugetanaytas leemiso gidida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sodoome asay Looxekko yida imaththatara laymatana koyidayssa bessees.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Medhe 19:1-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Hessaththoka he asati barkka ba agumo kaallidi barkka ba asho tuniseettes; baappe bollara dizaytas azazettettenna; istti salon bonchchora dizaytakka cayeettes. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Haray attoshin salo kiitanchchata halaqay Mikaaley Muse asho gishshas izara palamettishe, «Nena Goday hanqetto!» gides attiin izas cashsha qaala zaaribeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Daane 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Ajju 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Zaare 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zaka 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Hayti asati gidikko isttas erettontta ixxida miish ubbaa cash cayeettes; aykkoka erontta meheta mala coo mela qoppi ekkida miishshi isttas diikko istti hessan dhayana. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Istti Qayeele ogen bida gishshas miishshas giidi Bala7aame mala balan kundida; qasse Qoorey eqettida mala isttika eqettidi dhayda gishshas isttas aayye ana!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Medhe 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Tay 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16:1-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Hayti ha asati yeellay baynda layma hanora issi bolla intte diggisason beettiza wode inttes dhuphe gideettes; istti baas xalla qoppeettes; istti carkon biza iray baynda shaara mala; ayfey ayfiza woden ayfey baynda xaphoppe dhoqallettidi nam7uto melida miththa mala. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Istti yeellachchiza ba oosoza wolqqama abba dambala mala goppontto coppu histtizayta; girdi gida dhumay istta mernaas naagizayssanne coo mela waayettiza xoolintteta malakko!<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Addaameppe haa simmiin laappunththo yeleta gidida Heenookey, «Hekko Xoossi qooday baynda geeshsha kiitanchchatara asa ubbaa bolla pirdanaas yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Medhe 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />Heyti Xoossas goynnontta asati ooththida iita ooso gaason istta izi qaxxayana; addafekka Xoossi heyta baas goynnontta nagaranchchata bolla istti haasayda iita miishshata gishshas izi istta bolla pirdana» gides.<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Heyti he asati ubba wode zuuzumettizaytanne ay miishshankka ufayetti eronttayta; istti ba iita amo kaallizayta; istta doonan otoreteththa qaalay kumides; baas ba go7a koyishe as aadasheettes.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akeekisso Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Intteno ta siiqotoo! Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Hawaareti hayssafe kase yootida qaalaa akeekite. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Istti, «Wode wurseththan Xoossa sheneppe haakkidayti barkka ba iita amo kaallishe as qidhizayti yaana» giidi inttes kase yooti woththida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Phex 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Heyti as issaa issaafe shaakkizayta; asho amoteth kaallizaytanne isttan Xillo Ayanay bayndayta. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ta ishatoo! Intte gidikko ubbaafe bollara intte geeshsha ammanon minni eqqite; Xillo Ayanankka minni woossite. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi ba maaroteththan inttena mernaa de7on gaththanayssa naagettishe inttenateththaa Xoossaa siiqon naagite.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Sidhishe diza asatas mishettite. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Issi issi asata tamappe kessi ekki ashshite; haratas yashshateththan mishettite shin nagaran tunida istta asateth bochchida may7oka ubbaa ixxite.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Inttena kundeththafe ashshanaassinne inttena wosoy bayndayta histtidi ufayssan ba bonchcho sinth shiishshanaas dandayzayssas, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />izi xalla nuus Xoossanne dhale gidida Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara benippe doommidi ha7i gakkanaassinne mernaaskka bonchchoynne gitateththi, wolqqaynne godateththi izas gido. Amiin.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>